{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q37", "domain": "wealth", "question": "此命主的出身贫或富？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字来看，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺水冷，木气衰弱，形成财多身弱之局。年柱丙戌伤官生财，虽有暖局之象，但身弱难担，父母宫代表早年环境，财星过旺而日主无力，主出身并非富贵。月柱辛丑七杀坐财，官杀混杂攻身，也暗示早年压力较大，资源有限。\n\n再观紫微斗数，父母宫天机化权配天梁庙旺，天梁为荫星，主父母有责任心，对命主有照顾，显示命主并非被遗弃。财帛宫（身宫）天府得地，有禄存同度，虽不算大富，但财源稳定，有积蓄之象。福德宫紫微旺，有右弼、天魁吉星，内心有追求，非贫贱之格。命宫天相陷弱，显示早期助力不足，需靠自己努力，但综合父母宫、财帛宫及财星配置，应属中等平稳之家。\n\n综合判断，命主出身于普通安稳家庭，既非大富大贵，也非贫困潦倒，符合小康之家的特征。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q37", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1c_R0_P2_G4\\details_2024_b1c_R0_P2_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 12217, "response_id": "c0f4b0dd-b496-4a8d-90d4-4b7073a24292", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 732, "completion_tokens": 711, "total_tokens": 1443, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 443}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 92}}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q38", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的身材外貌如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字与紫微斗数综合推演：\n\n- **八字结构**：乙木日主生于丑月，天干透庚辛官杀混杂，土金成势，日主身弱。乙为花草之木，金重克伐，身形多偏瘦削；辛金、庚金为白色，又得辰丑湿土生金，肤色易显白皙；丙火伤官透年干，略有文秀之气，但被辛合、坐戌墓，火力不足，不至红润；整体呈现秀气偏文弱之象。\n- **紫微斗数**：命宫丁酉，主星天相陷落，天相为“印星”主温和端正，落陷则气势不足，不易魁梧；辅星天钺，带有含蓄清秀气质。迁移宫廉贞破军陷，左辅地劫，变动性强而欠厚重。福德宫紫微旺、七杀平，右弼天魁，内心有气度但不外显威严。身宫天府得地，禄存火星，少年时期不主胖大。\n- **综合断貌**：身材偏瘦长或中等，肤色白，五官秀气而无浓眉大眼之威，整体给人温和文气之感，对应选项A最为契合。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q38", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1c_R0_P2_G4\\details_2024_b1c_R0_P2_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 16723, "response_id": "9e09578d-8d5a-4d5b-86eb-4a6c3859c937", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 767, "completion_tokens": 907, "total_tokens": 1674, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 624}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 127}}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q39", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2016年，家中发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n1. **八字原局**：命主日主乙木，生于丑月土旺，财多身弱，月干辛金七杀，时干庚金正官，官杀混杂克身。年柱丙戌，伤官生财，但丙辛合水，印星有助。日主乙木无强根，依赖水木运扶持。\n2. **2016年丙申流年**：流年天干丙火重现，与月干辛金相合，引动伤官合杀。地支申金正官，与命局年支戌土半会金局，官杀更旺。关键在于大运壬寅（约2008-2017年），大运地支寅木为乙木之根，流年申金与大运寅木形成“寅申冲”，此为金木交战，用神之根被冲拔，主突发的冲撞、车祸等意外灾祸。\n3. **六亲定位**：以偏财丑土为父星，月柱辛丑为父母宫。流年申金不直接冲刑丑土，但寅申冲为劫财与官杀之战，劫财可代表手足或自身，亦可对应父亲事业身体的变动。金旺木折，木主筋骨，金主锐器车马，多为交通血光之灾。结合选项，父亲严重车祸最为贴切。\n4. **紫微斗数辅参**：本命父母宫天机天梁化权，流年丙申引动天机再次化权，主长辈变动。大限命宫天相陷，被流年迁移宫廉贞化忌（双忌）冲照，田宅宫流年亦受引动，家宅不宁。太阳为父星，流年在申宫无冲破，但寅申冲之象仍显动荡。综合二者，更倾向于父亲突发意外导致无法工作，而非破产、离异或祖母去世。\n\n### 最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q39", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1c_R0_P2_G4\\details_2024_b1c_R0_P2_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 104274, "response_id": "53da2517-353a-4b25-98b9-7ea60fa63513", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 742, "completion_tokens": 5975, "total_tokens": 6717, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 5544}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 102}}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q40", "domain": "family", "question": "命主父亲现在的身家？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析  \n根据命主八字，乙木日主生于丑月，地支戌、丑、丑、辰四柱全土，财星极旺，乙木无强根，仅时支辰中微藏乙木余气，为财多身弱之局。偏财父星为己土，月支丑中藏己土，且月柱为父母宫，辛金七杀坐丑土偏财，说明父亲有较强的求财动力和社会打拼倾向。原局财星旺而不破，配合大运庚子（当前17岁），财星土为旺势，父亲当前经济状况不至于困窘，排除A。  \n\n紫微斗数盘中，父母宫在戌，主星天机得、天梁庙，天机化权，显示父亲聪慧、有权威，善以专业立身，天梁庙主稳重、有产业荫庇之象。然命宫天相落陷，身宫在财帛见天府得地加禄存，此象多主命主自身后天聚财能力佳，而非父亲现时已巨富。田宅宫空宫仅有天姚，暗示家族不动产或产业不显赫，父亲财富积累尚未达亿万级别。兄弟宫太阳得、巨门庙配文曲天马，太阳光辉显示父亲事业有一定社会地位，似属于中高阶白领、专业人士或自营事业有成者，而非顶级富豪。  \n\n综合分析，父亲应有稳定资产，处于小康以上、千万量级（马币）的机率较高，远不及亿万身家。  \n\n最终答案：C", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q40", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1c_R0_P2_G4\\details_2024_b1c_R0_P2_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 45172, "response_id": "ee7f708b-e062-42af-b78f-6011100c8800", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 734, "completion_tokens": 2481, "total_tokens": 3215, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2139}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 94}}
